<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-chenshu" book-id="b-chenshu-005" chapter-id="c-chenshu-005-lushan-office-death" source-id="s-chenshu-005-lushan-office-death-ws2374950">
  <p id="c-chenshu-005-lushan-office-death:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">太子詹事、揚州大中正<persName id="c-chenshu-005-lushan-office-death:p001:m0010" ref="jss_82r_1ct_AAAA">陸繕</persName>為尚書右僕射，國子祭酒<persName id="c-chenshu-005-lushan-office-death:p001:m0023" ref="b5c_v7o_svc_AA">徐陵</persName>為領軍將軍。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-005-lushan-office-death:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">甲寅，以尚書右僕射<persName id="c-chenshu-005-lushan-office-death:p002:m0009" ref="jss_82r_1ct_AAAA">陸繕</persName>為尚書左僕射</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-005-lushan-office-death:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">戊子，以尚書左僕射<persName id="c-chenshu-005-lushan-office-death:p003:m0009" ref="jss_82r_1ct_AAAA">陸繕</persName>為尚書僕射。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-005-lushan-office-death:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">尚書僕射<persName id="c-chenshu-005-lushan-office-death:p004:m0004" ref="jss_82r_1ct_AAAA">陸繕</persName>為尚書左僕射。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-005-lushan-office-death:p005" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">夏四月癸亥，尚書左僕射<persName id="c-chenshu-005-lushan-office-death:p005:m0011" ref="jss_82r_1ct_AAAA">陸繕</persName>卒。</p>
</text>
